graphify-lcm-hybrid
Copyright 2026 Cap'n Jules / BuccaneerSalvage

This repository is glue between two engines. It is not Graphify and it is not Hermes-LCM.
GitHub only lets one repo fork one parent, so the two engines live as
separate public forks under the same org:

  https://github.com/buccaneersalvage/graphify
    fork of https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify
  https://github.com/buccaneersalvage/hermes-lcm
    fork of https://github.com/stephenschoettler/hermes-lcm

